### List screens
GET http://localhost:5000/api/screens?page=1&limit=10

### Search screens
GET http://localhost:5000/api/screens?q=Screen

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/screens/screens-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/screens
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Screen 2",
  "theatre": "Galaxy Multiplex",
  "format": "3D",
  "capacity": 4
}
